3	cond	If the player has the requirements to start Eadgar's Ruse.
4	line	Sanfew	Ah, you've come just in time. I need a certain herb for the next part of the purification ritual...
4	line	Sanfew	It used to be quite common, but nowadays only the trolls know where to find it. They use it in their cooking, you see. It's a very prized ingredient.
4	line	Player	And what exactly do you want me to do?
4	line	Sanfew	Journey to the north into the land of the trolls, and find the secret of the herb the trolls call 'goutweed'.
4	line	Sanfew	My friend Eadgar lives in the area, and he may be able to help you. Bring some goutweed back and I will teach you something useful.
4	cond	If the player boosted Herblore to start the quest.
5	box	Before starting this quest, be aware that one or more of your skill levels are lower than what is required to fully complete it.
4	select	Start the Eadgar's Ruse quest?
4	option	Yes.
5	line	Player	I'll do it.
5	line	Sanfew	Thank you, adventurer!
5	action	end
4	option	No.
5	line	Player	No thanks.
5	line	Sanfew	Oh well. No doubt some other adventurer will eventually come who can help me.
5	action	end
3	option	Actually, I don't need to speak to you.
