1	option	Why do you live so close to the trolls?
2	line	Player	Why do you live so close to the trolls? Isn't it dangerous?
2	line	Eadgar	Well, I suppose I do keep getting captured by the trolls and thrown in prison...But they always release me in the end, I'm far too old and skinny for their tastes.
2	line	Eadgar	In any case, this is my home, and I'm not leaving it. And this area has the tastiest goats!
2	action	end
1	option	What do you have to offer?
2	line	Player	What do you have to offer?
2	line	Eadgar	The chef's recommendation for today is mountain goat stew. I'll give some stew in exchange for logs for my fire. They're hard to come by around here.
