1	line	Player	Er, hi.
1	line	Burntmeat	Hmm? What human do in troll kitchen? Burntmeat tired of cooking goats. Human look tasty.
1	line	Player	Oh, you don't want to eat me! I'm a tough, hardened adventurer, not tender or tasty at all!
1	line	Burntmeat	Hmm. Burntmeat think you probably right. What human doing here?
1	line	Player	I'm on a quest to find some goutweed.
1	line	Burntmeat	Bwahahaha! Burntmeat not give his greatest cooking secret away so easily.
1	line	Burntmeat	But Burntmeat also has quest for human!
1	line	Player	Really? What is it?
1	line	Burntmeat	Bring back a tasty human for Burntmeat's stew. If you find tasty human, Burntmeat will give you good reward.
1	line	Player	Right. I'll just...go fetch that for you then. Bye!
1	action	end
